!.env.example
# Shared by every build that uses the repository root as its context -
# the agent image AND `docker compose build api`. So this excludes only
# what NEITHER image needs: the customer's data, the frontend, test
# material. `apps/api/src` and `apps/web` are deliberately not here: the
# API image is built from this same context, and it builds the frontend
# into itself. `**/node_modules` and `**/dist` below keep the heavy,
# regenerable parts of apps/web out regardless.
evals
infra
scripts
packages/core/tests
apps/agent/tests
*.md
livekit.toml
